{"id":"47dbc06b9bee7a7b","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbmaxelim.md","title":"One-coordinate maximization and a reconstruction selector","display":"df-pbmaxelim — One-coordinate maximization and a reconstruction selector","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbmaxelim","aliases":["27-df-pbmaxelim"],"display":"df-pbmaxelim — One-coordinate maximization and a reconstruction selector","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbopt]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.4.2","source_statement":"Equations (13.41)–(13.42)","source_printed_pages":"587–588","source_pdf_pages":"611–612","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbmaxelim"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbmaxelim</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbmaxelim — One-coordinate maximization and a reconstruction selector"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.4.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Equations (13.41)–(13.42)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"587–588"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"611–612"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>待定义消元与选择器记号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxElim},\\mathrm{MaxSel}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxElim},\\mathrm{MaxSel}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad\\iota_b(y)_1\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\quad\\iota_b(y)_{j+1}\\coloneqq y_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad\\iota_b(y)_1\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\quad\\iota_b(y)_{j+1}\\coloneqq y_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_f:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\Delta_f(y)\\coloneqq f(\\iota_1(y))-f(\\iota_0(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_f:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\Delta_f(y)\\coloneqq f(\\iota_1(y))-f(\\iota_0(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f):\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y)\\coloneqq f(\\iota_0(y))+\\max\\{0,\\Delta_f(y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f):\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y)\\coloneqq f(\\iota_0(y))+\\max\\{0,\\Delta_f(y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f):\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)(y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\Delta_f(y)&gt;0,\\\\0&amp;\\Delta_f(y)\\leq0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f):\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)(y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;\\Delta_f(y)&gt;0,\\\\0&amp;\\Delta_f(y)\\leq0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将书中首变量消元写成类型明确的降一元算子和回溯选择器；相等时固定选0。每个函数的定义域/值域均显式；n=1 时剩余输入为空向量仍合法。没有把该数学算子声称为多项式时间求解器；一般表示中的消元膨胀仍可能很大。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\geq1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]），$y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}$，$b\\in\\mathbb B$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxElim},\\mathrm{MaxSel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad\\iota_b(y)_1\\coloneqq b,\\qquad\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\quad\\iota_b(y)_{j+1}\\coloneqq y_j.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_f:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\Delta_f(y)\\coloneqq f(\\iota_1(y))-f(\\iota_0(y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f):\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f)(y)\\coloneqq f(\\iota_0(y))+\\max\\{0,\\Delta_f(y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f):\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)(y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&\\Delta_f(y)>0,\\\\0&\\Delta_f(y)\\leq0.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1854,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbmaxelim|df-pbmaxelim — One-coordinate maximization and a reconstruction selector]]"},{"id":"f1791ff3e14b4575","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可追踪的内部入口依次为 [[27-df-functionalequation]] 与 [[27-df-equationalclass]]，[[27-df-fiterror]] 与 [[27-df-bestfit]]，[[27-df-missingbits]] 与 [[27-df-missingextensions]]，以及 [[27-df-pbextension]]、[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]。它们的完整数学条件仍由各自的 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 给出，本摘要不增加新的数学前提。"},{"id":"22bac6157fe16489","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\iota_b:\\mathbb B^{n-1}\\to\\mathbb B^n$（$b\\in\\mathbb B$）、$\\Delta_f,\\mathrm{MaxElim}(f),\\mathrm{MaxSel}(f)$ 见 [[27-df-pbmaxelim]]，$\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbopt]]。"}],"outgoing":["a668791f62b82e2a"]}